<title>USA: DavCo to open 5 stores with Exxon.</title>
<headline>DavCo to open 5 stores with Exxon.</headline>
<dateline>CROFTON, Md. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>DavCo Restaurants Inc said Friday it has agreed with Exxon Corp to test up to five combined Wendy's restaurants and Exxon gas stations in the mid-Atlantic region of the United States.</p>
<p>The company said each facility will consist of a Wendy's Old Fashioned Hamburger Restaurant, a convenience store and an Exxon gas station.</p>
<p>DavCo was not immediately able to provide financial information on the project.</p>
</text>
